  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-08",
  "title": "不做約定",
  "storyCode": "2-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c9bc3c1d3f1238f09d1b66f2e574c24a75ded72863d938682b706ad58630bb19",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "呼，呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "近衛局的護送隊已經安全離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "而敵人嘛——暫時也不打算放過我們的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只要敵人還不知道米莎被近衛局接走，他們就越把注意力放在我們身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這樣的話，米莎那邊就越安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "其實，為什麼龍門和整合運動都要找這個孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不清楚，可能性很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我能想到的是，這孩子本人，或者只有她知情的什麼東西......足以影響——甚至，左右龍門的安危。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是的，也許是情報，也許是資訊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "所以龍門和整合運動，都想得到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——真是場危險的較量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不管是米莎、我們還是近衛局，都無法置身其外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我們是不是被夾在很尷尬的位置啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "什麼都不知道，又什麼都要管......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不，不清楚呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但陳長官那裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我有預感。事情不會這麼簡單就結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "阿米婭，我們還有什麼任務嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "需要我們陪同你回羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不用了，現在我們戰鬥起來沒有什麼顧忌，應該是沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "如果是這樣的話，我們就回去待命了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "接下來，希望你們能繼續進行偵察活動，調查整合運動在龍門內滲透的具體情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我們雖然已經把米莎交給了近衛局，但整合運動......依然讓我感到些許不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "好說~那我們走了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，交給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "大家，我們不知道還有多少整合運動在這裡潛伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "做好準備，不要放鬆警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "接下來，我們將繼續在高層建築內部轉移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "必要的話，可以透過天台移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這樣，我們能獲得比在街頭巷尾和整合運動纏鬥更大的優勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "有必要的話，我們也要引誘整合運動與我們作戰，在我們的掌控下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "一切都已安排妥當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "該動身了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "——說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "進攻龍門對於整合運動，確實有戰略性的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "拿下龍門，整合運動能獲得種種優勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "但是風險與代價都很高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "——為什麼那麼執著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "你看見那座建築物了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "我看得見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "那是龍門的象徵。也是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "我回到這裡，不僅是要奪回本屬於感染者的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "我還要讓他——付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "而且——你難道不覺得，這一切也很有趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "對吧，塔露拉——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
